35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The winter closures were severe, but the community halls kept their timetables. This suggests local resilience.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The bus links in the outer wards are gone, leaving residents with an hour's round trip.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The vehicle running line overran by a third last year. The equipment budget was under, though.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The old outreach stops averaged forty visitors, which was higher than the main building midweek.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, does the equipment surplus help offset the vehicle overrun for a mobile service?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, if outreach worked so well, why did the funding lapse?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"The grant only covers session fees for twelve months. After that, the flat budget carries them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"The digitisation project left half the images unindexed. The partner-run groups still meet, though.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,The technician who certified the power tools retired in spring. That is a gap for any workshop.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The delivery windows for scanning slip when larger clients book first. That is a risk for archives.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"Evening room bookings are full, but remote catalogue use peaks after nine. We are missing the night users.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"The endowment covers capital items, but the operating budget is tight after the first year.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,The partner-run groups are self-sustaining. That is a model we should consider for new services.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The neighbourhood associations staff their own sessions. They have the people, but we lack the supervision.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
